{"id":"vod_bf_151570","vodId":"151570","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"感谢对战 ～大小姐才不玩格斗游戏～","name_cn":"感谢对战 ～大小姐才不玩格斗游戏～","date":"2026-01-01","year":"2026","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"更新至第12集","images":{"common":"https://p.bfvp26.com/upload/vod/20260707-1/ab51a580b1cc627c3598f8c07b167041.webp"},"summary":"深月绫进入了以淑女教育著称的黑美女子学院，意外发现校内备受瞩目的“白百合大人”——夜绘美绪，在无人的教室里沉迷于格斗游戏。由于校规禁止游戏，美绪要求绫严格保密。然而，再次相遇时，美绪识破了绫同为游戏玩家的身份，并恳求与她一较高下。面对美绪对游戏纯粹的热情，绫虽心生抵触，却未表现出理解她为何放弃游戏的态度，最终接受了挑战。在较量中，两人作为稀有的女性格斗游戏玩家，逐渐理解彼此，建立了深厚的友谊。随后，她们冒着被退学的风险，与同为隐藏游戏爱好者的前辈一之濑珠树和犬井夕一起，更加投入地沉浸在格斗游戏的世界中。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2026-09-22 19:34:43","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://bfeng11.com/video/ganxieduizhandaxiaojiecaibuwangedouyouxi/07333e4b373e/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://bfeng11.com/video/ganxieduizhandaxiaojiecaibuwangedouyouxi/36f17c994e85/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://bfeng11.com/video/ganxieduizhandaxiaojiecaibuwangedouyouxi/fa5c3a83e233/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://bfeng11.com/video/ganxieduizhandaxiaojiecaibuwangedouyouxi/926d08c35342/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://bfeng11.com/video/ganxieduizhandaxiaojiecaibuwangedouyouxi/9e61a9c2536c/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://bfeng11.com/video/ganxieduizhandaxiaojiecaibuwangedouyouxi/e016f1d0cd32/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://fengbao12.com/video/ganxieduizhandaxiaojiecaibuwangedouyouxi/32737dd946df/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://fengbao12.com/video/ganxieduizhandaxiaojiecaibuwangedouyouxi/374a9338f0dc/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://fengbao12.com/video/ganxieduizhandaxiaojiecaibuwangedouyouxi/75046edfd579/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://fengbao12.com/video/ganxieduizhandaxiaojiecaibuwangedouyouxi/eb106472c71e/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://fengbao12.com/v